1
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:04,300
God, you're beautiful.
天啊，你真美

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,300
Why are we fighting this?
我們為什麼要抗拒這種感覺呢？

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:10,330
You know you want it to happen as much as I do.
你跟我一樣都想要的

4
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:15,900
I want you. I need you.
我想要你，我需要你

5
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,250
Let me make love to you.
讓我跟你做愛

6
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:23,920
I don't wanna stand in the way of true love or anything..
我不想要介入這場真愛還是什麼的

7
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:27,420
but I think a cantaloupe might hurt less.
但是我想如果你找一個甜瓜來愛 可能會比較不痛

8
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:29,990
No, I'm rehearsing my lines.
不是啦，我是在練習我的台詞

9
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,960
They're giving me a romantic story on Days of Our Lives.
他們在《我們的日子》裡頭幫我 安插了愛情故事情節

10
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:36,890
It's the first time my character's gotten one. I'm nervous. I want it to be good.
這是我的角色第一次戀愛 我很緊張，我想要把他演好

11
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:41,530
I haven't seen you this worked-up since you did that dog-food commercial..
自從你上次做那個狗食廣告之後 我就沒有看你這麼認真練習過

12
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:45,930
and you thought you were gonna be with a real talking dog.
而且那次你還以為是要跟 一隻真的會說話的狗一起演出

13
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:48,670
Yeah, that was a disappointment.
是啊，那次我真的很失望

14
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:52,780
You wanna come down to the set and tell me if I'm doing okay?
你想過來片廠看我表現如何嗎？

15
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:54,540
- Are you serious? - Yeah.
-真的嗎？ -是啊

16
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:57,550
You just have to promise not to get thrown out again.
只要你保證不要再被趕出去

17
00:00:57,750 --> 00:01:00,480
- That was an honest mistake. - Right.
-那只是個錯誤 -沒錯

18
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:05,060
"Oh, my God. Is this the men's room? I feel so foolish.
「天啊，這是男廁所嗎？ 我真是好蠢」

19
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:09,060
Have you always known you wanted to be an actor?"
「你一直都很清楚自己要當演員嗎？」

20
00:01:10,130 --> 00:01:13,290
Yeah, that was an awesome day.
是啊，真是精采的一天

21
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,865
The One With Rachels Dream

00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:17,865
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

22
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:52,640
- Hey. - Hey.
-嘿 -嘿

23
00:01:53,110 --> 00:01:56,540
You guys wanna come eat dinner at the restaurant in the next few weeks?
你們接下來幾個星期 有想要到我們餐廳用餐嗎？

24
00:01:56,740 --> 00:01:59,470
- I'd love to. - Well, you can't.
-我很想 -喔，可能沒辦法

25
00:02:00,820 --> 00:02:04,340
- We're booked solid for the next month. - Well, I can't give you a massage..
-我們下個月全部都被訂滿了 -喔，我不能幫你按摩

26
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:07,980
because my license has been revoked again.
因為我的執照又被取消了

27
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:11,720
- Phoebe, what happened? - Well, it was an accident, you know.
-菲比，發生什麼事？ -喔，只是個意外

28
00:02:11,890 --> 00:02:15,330
It's a lot of oil and sometimes the hand just slips.
當用很多精油的時候 有時候手是會滑的

29
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:20,360
So the restaurant's doing well, you say?
所以你是說餐廳生意很不錯囉？

30
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:23,300
It is so great. There are people lining up in the street..
好極了，還有人排隊排到街上…

31
00:02:23,470 --> 00:02:26,870
to taste my food. Saturday, there's a waiting list of 50 people.
只是為了嘗嘗我做的食物 下個星期六的後補名單上有五十個人

32
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:30,170
I know how that feels. Last semester, I had two students..
我知道那是什麼感覺

33
00:02:30,350 --> 00:02:33,800
who wanted to take my 1:00 class, but it was full.
上個學期我有兩個學生想上我的 一點鐘的課，但是那堂課已經滿了

34
00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:37,880
So they had to take my 5:00.
所以他們只能上我五點的課

35
00:02:39,650 --> 00:02:41,250
That's not the same.
那一點也不像

36
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,890
Have I got a surprise for you. Pack your bags.
我要給你個驚喜，回家去打包吧

37
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:50,500
Oh, no. You guys aren't supposed to get divorced for seven years.
喔，不，你們七年之內不可以離婚的

38
00:02:52,070 --> 00:02:55,330
What? No, I'm taking Monica to a romantic inn in Vermont.
什麼？不，我是要帶摩妮卡 去佛蒙特州的浪漫小木屋度假

39
00:02:55,500 --> 00:03:01,070
Oh, good. Okay, good for you. Trying to recapture the magic.
還好，好的，很好 試著找回往日情懷

41
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,780
- So can you get out of work? - Honey, I can't.
-你可以請假嗎？ -親愛的，我沒有辦法

42
00:03:04,950 --> 00:03:08,710
- Things are crazy at the restaurant. - You're really that busy?
-餐廳現在忙瘋了 -你真的那麼忙嗎？

43
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:11,580
Yeah. I'm sorry, I really am.
是的，我很抱歉，我真的很忙

44
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:15,090
That's okay. I'll just try and reschedule.
沒關係，我來試著更改日期好了

45
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:19,120
Hi, this is Chandler Bing. I made a reservation there..
嗨，我是錢德賓 我有預定過小木屋

46
00:03:19,290 --> 00:03:21,660
and I need to change it.
現在我需要更改日期

47
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:26,530
What do you mean, it's nonrefundable? Well, can I just come some other time?
無法退費是什麼意思？ 我不能擇期再去嗎？

48
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,190
Can't you make an exception?
你不能破例嗎？

49
00:03:29,370 --> 00:03:32,200
Tell them I'm a chef at a big New York restaurant.
告訴他們我是紐約一家大餐廳的主廚

50
00:03:32,410 --> 00:03:36,810
Tell them that in two weeks, I will once again be a masseuse in good standing.
告訴他們在兩星期以後 我又會再度成為很棒的按摩師

51
00:03:38,210 --> 00:03:41,880
Look, this is ridiculous. I'm not paying for that room, okay?
聽著，這實在太可笑了 這錢我不會付的，你聽懂了嗎？

52
00:03:42,050 --> 00:03:44,920
Well, thank you very much.
好的，非常謝謝你

53
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:47,150
Yeah, I'm going to Vermont.
我得去佛蒙特州

54
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:52,190
- Don't worry, use your travel insurance. - I don't have travel insurance.
-別擔心，你可以用你的旅遊保險 -我沒有旅遊保險

55
00:03:52,390 --> 00:03:55,520
Well, this is what happens when people live on the edge.
當人們活在危機邊緣的時候 就是會發生這種事

56
00:03:57,630 --> 00:03:59,960
- Honey, what are you gonna do? - I'll go.
-親愛的，你該怎麼辦呢？ -我去就是了

57
00:04:01,170 --> 00:04:02,660
Okay, I'll pick you up at 10.
好的，我十點去接你

58
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,300
Oh, go with you?
喔，跟你去嗎？

59
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:08,130
Oh, I can't go.
喔，我不能去

60
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:12,410
Why don't you take Ross?
你何不跟羅斯一起去呢？

61
00:04:12,580 --> 00:04:16,780
Don't you think that'll be a little weird? I mean, two guys in a romantic inn?
你不覺得那會有點奇怪嗎？ 兩個大男人住一間浪漫小木屋？

62
00:04:17,090 --> 00:04:20,850
- No, not if the room has two beds. - I guess.
-不會啊，如果有兩張床就好了 -我猜也是

63
00:04:21,020 --> 00:04:24,960
It still seems a little.. "Moonlight boat ride"?!
但是還是有點… 「月光船游」！

64
00:04:27,767 --> 00:04:29,200
（銀杯攝影棚）

65
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:32,760
Joey, is this the bed where Olivia lost her virginity?
喬伊，這是奧莉維亞獻出第一夜 的那張床嗎？

66
00:04:32,930 --> 00:04:35,630
I don't know, but one of the extras sure did.
我不知道，倒是有個臨時演員獻出過

67
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:39,260
Listen, Rach. Thanks again for coming down to watch my scenes.
瑞秋，再次謝謝你過來看我的演出

68
00:04:39,470 --> 00:04:42,970
Please, honey. Just the fact that you want me here to support you, I'm..
拜託，親愛的 我光是想到你要我的支持，我就…

69
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:47,980
Oh, my God. Is that Christian Saunders? He is so gorgeous!
喔，天啊，那是克利斯桑德嗎？ 他真的是非常帥！

70
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:50,840
And also, so gay.
而且是非常同志

71
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:54,960
Well, in my head, he's done some pretty not-gay stuff.
在我腦海中，他做了很多不是同志的事

72
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:59,530
Well, at the Christmas party, him and Santa did some definitely-gay stuff.
在聖誕晚會上，他跟聖誕老公公 做了很多絕對是同志的事

73
00:04:59,690 --> 00:05:01,890
Joey? Joey, we're ready for you.
喬伊？喬伊，我們準備好要拍你了

74
00:05:02,060 --> 00:05:04,120
Okay. All right, wish me luck.
好的，祝我好運

75
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:08,000
Okay. Not that you need it, but good.. God! Is that Chase Lassiter?
你不是真的需要運氣才做的好，但… 天啊！那是傑斯萊西特嗎？

76
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:11,400
- He's straight, right? - Rach, if you weren't here wondering..
-他是異性戀，對吧？ -瑞秋，如果沒有你在這裡猜測…

77
00:05:11,570 --> 00:05:15,170
if these guys were gay, I don't know if I could do this.
這些男的是不是同志… 我還真的不知道我能不能演的好

78
00:05:15,340 --> 00:05:18,470
I'm sorry, you're right. I'm sorry. Good luck.
我很抱歉，你說的對 很抱歉，祝你好運

79
00:05:18,650 --> 00:05:22,140
On a bell, please. Quietly.
拜託準備好，安靜

80
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:24,110
And action!
開拍！

81
00:05:25,350 --> 00:05:27,450
Drake, what are you doing here?
德克，你在這裡做什麼呢？

82
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:29,490
Stopping you from marrying the wrong man..
阻止你嫁給不對的人…

83
00:05:29,660 --> 00:05:31,780
and making the biggest mistake of your life.
犯下你這輩子最大的錯誤

84
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:34,050
- Get out. - You don't love him.
-出去 -你並不愛他

85
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:35,820
What do you know about love?
你知道什麼是愛嗎？

86
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,830
I know what I felt that night when we kissed under the bridge.
我知道那晚我們在 橋下接吻的感覺是什麼

87
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:42,660
- That kiss never happened. - Well, what about this one?
-那個吻並沒有發生 -那麼，這個呢？

88
00:05:44,740 --> 00:05:47,540
Now, I told you to get out.
我說過了，滾出去

89
00:05:47,710 --> 00:05:49,680
Fine, I'll go.
好，我走

90
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:52,410
But let me ask you one question.
但是讓我問你一個問題

91
00:05:52,580 --> 00:05:56,850
- You look real familiar. Have we..? - Shh! He's asking her a question.
-你看起來很面熟，我們有…？ -噓！他要問她問題

92
00:05:57,750 --> 00:06:01,750
Can you live the rest of your life never knowing what we could have been?
你可以渡過一生而不知道 我們如果在一起會是如何嗎？

93
00:06:01,990 --> 00:06:04,920
- I don't have a choice. - Yes, you do.
-我沒有選擇 -你有選擇的

94
00:06:05,090 --> 00:06:09,690
Yes, you do. I'm the one who doesn't have a choice because I..
你有的，我才是那個沒有選擇的人 因為我…

95
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:11,590
Because I can't stop loving you.
因為我無法停止愛你

96
00:06:13,100 --> 00:06:17,000
- Don't say that. - Tell me to stop.
-別那樣說 -你叫我停下來吧

97
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:18,800
Just..
你只要…

98
00:06:19,870 --> 00:06:21,930
tell me to stop.
叫我停下來

99
00:06:23,210 --> 00:06:25,940
- Cut! - No!
-卡！ -不！

100
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:30,570
Or, cut. You know, that's your call.
卡也好，那是你的決定

101
00:06:32,450 --> 00:06:34,440
- Everything was delicious. - Thank you.
-每道菜都很美味 -謝謝你

102
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:37,150
It was. The duck in particular was superb.
真的，尤其是鴨肉更是美味絕倫

103
00:06:37,330 --> 00:06:39,120
Thank you.
謝謝你

104
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,160
You haven't said anything.
你還沒有開口說話

105
00:06:44,930 --> 00:06:47,420
Actually, I do have one small complaint.
其實我有一個小小的抱怨

106
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:52,230
Well, please, I welcome criticism.
喔，請說，我歡迎各種批評指教

107
00:06:52,910 --> 00:06:56,170
The musician right outside the restaurant is kind of a mood killer.
餐廳外面的歌手有點破壞氣氛

108
00:06:56,380 --> 00:06:57,500
What musician?
什麼歌手？

109
00:07:17,470 --> 00:07:18,900
What are you doing here?
你在這裡做什麼呢？

110
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:22,590
You said you had customers lined up in the street, so I'm here to entertain.
你說你們的客人都排隊排到街上 所以我就過來娛樂他們了

111
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:26,070
- Great. - Yeah, it really has been great too.
-很好 -是啊，一切都進行的很好

112
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,170
They must have seen me play before..
他們一定有看我表演過

113
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:30,810
because they requested a bunch of my songs.
因為他們一直要點我的許多歌曲

114
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:33,340
Yeah, "You Suck"..
像是《你遜斃了》

115
00:07:33,510 --> 00:07:35,480
and "Shut Up and Go Home."
還有《閉嘴回家去》

116
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:41,780
Listen, Phoebe. You know how much I love listening to your music..
聽著，菲比，你知道我很愛聽你的歌的

117
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:44,790
- but.. - But what?
-但是… -但是什麼？

118
00:07:46,390 --> 00:07:48,860
This is kind of a classy place.
這是個蠻高級的場所

119
00:07:50,330 --> 00:07:51,660
Okay, say no more.
好的，不用多說了

120
00:07:55,870 --> 00:07:57,530
Everyone!
大家一起來！

121
00:08:02,610 --> 00:08:04,270
Classy, huh?
高級，不是嗎？

122
00:08:09,850 --> 00:08:11,820
Hi, Chandler Bing. I have a reservation.
嗨，我是錢德賓，我有訂房

123
00:08:11,990 --> 00:08:14,890
Welcome to the Chestnut lnn. Where are you joining us from?
歡迎來到小木屋 你們是從哪裡來的呢？

124
00:08:15,060 --> 00:08:17,290
- New York. - The Big Apple.
-紐約 -大蘋果

125
00:08:18,230 --> 00:08:22,250
He's wound up. We had to stop at every maple-candy stand on the way here.
他太興奮了，我們來這裡的路上 每間楓糖糖果店都有停下來

126
00:08:22,430 --> 00:08:25,700
I ate all my gifts for everybody.
我吃光了要買給大家的禮物

127
00:08:27,170 --> 00:08:30,470
I'm sorry, there's no record of your reservation in the computer.
我很抱歉，電腦沒有登記您的預定

128
00:08:30,670 --> 00:08:34,840
- That's impossible. Check again, please. - Check again, please.
-那是不可能的，請再查一次 -請再查一次

129
00:08:36,410 --> 00:08:39,540
- I'm sorry, it's not here. - It's not there.
-我很抱歉，沒有 -沒有

130
00:08:40,210 --> 00:08:43,740
Let me get this straight. I called to try to cancel my reservation..
讓我搞清楚，我有打過電話來 試著要取消我的預約

131
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:47,750
was told it's not refundable. Then we drove six hours all the way up here..
你們告訴我不能取消 然後我們開了六小時的車到這裡

132
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:51,090
- and now we don't have a reservation? - I don't know what to say.
-現在你又說我們沒有訂房？ -我不知道該說什麼

133
00:08:51,290 --> 00:08:53,520
She doesn't know what to say.
她不知道該說什麼

134
00:08:53,690 --> 00:08:55,820
Just give us the cheapest room you have.
那給我們最便宜的房間就好了

135
00:08:56,030 --> 00:09:00,060
The only thing we have available is our deluxe suite. The rate is $600.
我們現在剩下來的房間就只有精緻套房 價格是每晚六百元

136
00:09:00,230 --> 00:09:02,670
- That's insane. - It's totally insane.
-這真的過分 -真是太過分了

137
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:06,860
Dude, let's drive home. We'll hit all the maple-candy stores on the way back..
我們開車回家吧，可以在回家路上的 再去每間楓糖糖果店

138
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:11,670
and if they're closed, then maybe we'll tap a tree and make some ourselves.
而且如果他們關門了 或許我們可以找棵樹自己做楓糖

139
00:09:13,250 --> 00:09:16,710
Does that room have a closet I can lock him in?
那個房間有個衣櫥 可以讓我把他鎖起來嗎？

140
00:09:17,950 --> 00:09:20,750
- We'll take it. - Great.
-我們要那間房 -太好了

141
00:09:21,260 --> 00:09:24,380
They are totally ripping us off! Three hundred dollars each?
他們完全就是在剝削我們 一人三百塊？

142
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:26,290
"Each?" I'm your date.
「一人」？我是你的約會伴侶耶

143
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,730
So I pay for everything and have no sex.
所以我得負擔所有的開銷 而且還不能炒飯

144
00:09:31,900 --> 00:09:34,660
Oh, life before Monica.
喔，在有摩妮卡之前的生活就是如此

145
00:09:34,900 --> 00:09:36,200
Dude, don't worry about it.
老兄，別擔心

146
00:09:36,370 --> 00:09:40,430
I know how to make your money back. This is a nice hotel. Plenty of amenities.
我知道要如何讓你花的錢回本 這是間不錯的飯店，有很多福利設施

147
00:09:40,610 --> 00:09:45,410
We just load up on those. Like those apples. Instead of taking one..
我們只要盡量拿走那些東西就好了 像是這些蘋果，不要只拿一個

148
00:09:45,580 --> 00:09:47,810
I take six.
我給他拿六個

149
00:09:48,420 --> 00:09:52,110
Great. At $100 an apple, we're there.
太棒了，一個蘋果一百塊，我們辦到了

150
00:09:52,290 --> 00:09:56,590
Come on, you get the idea. You know, we'll make our money back in no time.
別這樣，你知道我的意思的 我們很快就可以回本了

151
00:09:56,790 --> 00:10:00,280
- Dude, you're shaking. - It's the sugar. Could you hold the apple?
-老兄，你在發抖耶 -是糖在搞怪，可以幫我拿蘋果嗎？

152
00:10:05,830 --> 00:10:07,230
- Hi. - Hey.
-嗨 -嘿

153
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:12,200
Joey, I gotta tell you, I have been thinking all day about that scene you did.
喬伊，我要跟你說 我整天都在想你的演出

154
00:10:12,370 --> 00:10:14,500
I mean, you were amazing.
你真是棒透了

155
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:18,010
You know, the writing was good. And the director's good.
你知道的，編劇很棒 導演也很棒

156
00:10:18,180 --> 00:10:20,310
And my costar's good.
我的對戲演員也很棒

157
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:22,510
But they're not as good as me!
但是他們還是不如我棒！

158
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:26,150
You have to tell me what happens tomorrow.
你得告訴我明天會發生什麼事

159
00:10:26,350 --> 00:10:29,050
I'm going over the script now. Wanna read lines with me?
我現在正在看劇本 你要幫我一起對台詞嗎？

160
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:32,780
Me? Oh, I'm not an actress.
我嗎？喔，我不是演員的料

161
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:36,830
- All right, I can ask Monica. - Screw her! That part is mine!
-好吧，我去找摩妮卡 -去她的！那角色是我的！

162
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,760
Okay, so just from the top of the page right here.
好的，從這一頁開頭開始

163
00:10:39,930 --> 00:10:41,560
Okay.
好的

164
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:48,010
Hello, Drake. I'm surprised to see you here.
哈囉，德克，我很訝異會在此看到你

165
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:51,440
- I can't believe you married him. - Well, what choice did I have?
-我不敢相信你嫁給他了 -我能有什麼選擇呢？

166
00:10:51,650 --> 00:10:54,910
He was keeping my sister in a dungeon.
他把我妹妹關在地牢裡

167
00:10:57,550 --> 00:11:00,820
So, what about us? Everything we feel for each other?
那我們呢？我們對彼此的感覺呢？

168
00:11:00,990 --> 00:11:03,460
It's over. You have to accept that.
結束了，你必須要接受

169
00:11:03,660 --> 00:11:08,120
How can I, knowing I'll never hold you in my arms again..
當我知道我再也無法把你擁入懷中 或是碰觸你的肌膚

170
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:12,390
or touch your skin or feel your lips..
或是感覺你的雙唇 或是永遠無法跟你做愛

171
00:11:12,930 --> 00:11:15,560
knowing I'll never make love to you?
我怎麼能夠做的到呢？

172
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:19,230
How can I accept that I can never kiss you again..
我怎麼能接受 我再也無法親吻你

173
00:11:19,410 --> 00:11:22,430
when it's all I can do not to kiss you right now?
而我現在最想要做的 就只是親吻你

174
00:11:25,750 --> 00:11:26,940
Kiss me.
親我

175
00:11:28,180 --> 00:11:29,620
What?
什麼？

176
00:11:30,690 --> 00:11:32,050
Kiss me.
親我

177
00:11:33,090 --> 00:11:36,960
- Rach, it doesn't say that. - No, I'm saying it.
-瑞秋，劇本不是那樣寫的 -不，是我說的

178
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:40,590
- But.. - Just don't talk.
-但是… -不要說話

179
00:11:47,740 --> 00:11:49,700
Well, that's new.
那倒是新的夢

180
00:11:57,380 --> 00:12:00,840
Hi, this is Ross Geller in suite 206.
嗨，我是206號房的羅斯蓋勒

181
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:02,810
I've forgotten a couple of things.
我忘了帶幾樣東西

182
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:07,250
Could you have some complimentary toiletries sent up to my room?
你可以幫我送幾樣贈送的 衛生用品到我房間裡來嗎？

183
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:11,220
Thank you. Okay, a toothbrush, toothpaste..
謝謝你 好的，牙刷、牙膏

184
00:12:11,390 --> 00:12:17,420
razor, mouthwash, deodorant, floss, Band-Aids, shaving cream, after-shave.
刮鬍刀、漱口水、體香劑、牙線 繃帶、刮鬍乳液、收斂水

185
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:19,660
And I feel like I'm forgetting something.
我覺得我好像漏了什麼東西

186
00:12:19,830 --> 00:12:23,860
Is there anything else you have that I haven't asked for already?
你還有什麼東西是我沒有提到的呢？

187
00:12:24,770 --> 00:12:28,000
Yeah, go ahead, send up some tampons.
好，那就送一些衛生棉條上來

188
00:12:30,410 --> 00:12:32,040
- What'd you get? - USA Today.
-你拿了什麼？ -《美國時報》

189
00:12:32,210 --> 00:12:34,240
Nice. Put it with the others.
很好，跟其它的放在一起

190
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:38,420
And I also got two more apples.
而且我還多拿了兩個蘋果

191
00:12:38,620 --> 00:12:40,550
We're four short of a bushel!
還差四個就可以做水果花籃了！

192
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:45,550
God, I feel so alive. I love being in the country!
天啊，我覺得充滿活力 我喜歡鄉間生活！

193
00:12:45,730 --> 00:12:48,060
Also, got these great salt and pepper shakers..
還有，我從餐廳裡拿了這些…

194
00:12:48,230 --> 00:12:50,560
- from the restaurant. - That's not cool.
-鹽巴胡椒罐 -這不好

195
00:12:51,730 --> 00:12:54,460
Dude, none of this is cool.
兄弟，這一切都不好

196
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:58,600
Look, Chandler, you have to find the line between stealing..
聽著，錢德，你要找出介於偷竊跟…

197
00:12:58,770 --> 00:13:01,070
and taking what the hotel owes you.
拿取飯店欠你的東西之間的界線

198
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:04,080
For example: A hair dryer, no, no.
例如，吹風機，不不不

199
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:07,370
But shampoos and conditioners, yes, yes.
但是洗髮精跟潤發乳，可以可以

200
00:13:08,650 --> 00:13:12,110
Now, the salt shaker is off limits.
鹽巴罐是不行的

201
00:13:12,290 --> 00:13:16,220
But the salt..
但是鹽巴…

202
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:18,290
I wish I'd thought this through.
我希望我剛剛有想清楚點

203
00:13:19,290 --> 00:13:23,320
I think I get what you mean, though. Like, the lamp is the hotel's..
我想我知道你的意思了 就像檯燈是飯店的…

204
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:26,690
but the bulbs.. Oh, you already got that.
但是燈泡… 喔，你已經拿了

205
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:29,800
Not my first time in a hotel, my friend.
我的朋友 這可不是我第一次住飯店

206
00:13:29,970 --> 00:13:32,730
- Okay, how about this? - No, no, no.
-好的，那這個呢？ -不不不

207
00:13:32,910 --> 00:13:37,400
- You can't take the remote control. - Yes, but the batteries.
-你不能拿遙控器 -是的，但是可以拿電池

208
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:44,140
Thank you. Thank you very much.
謝謝，太謝謝你了

209
00:13:44,750 --> 00:13:47,810
- Let's celebrate with some maple candy. - No!
-我們來吃楓糖慶祝吧 -不！

210
00:13:49,190 --> 00:13:51,160
At least tell me where you hid it.
至少告訴我你把它藏哪裡去了

211
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:55,562
（中央咖啡廳）

212
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:59,130
- Can I ask you a question? - Yeah.
-我可以問你一個問題嗎？ -好的

213
00:13:59,430 --> 00:14:02,430
Have you ever had any..
你有沒有作過任何…

214
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:07,130
weird, romantic dreams?
奇異的… 浪漫的夢呢？

215
00:14:08,380 --> 00:14:09,970
Let me think.
讓我想想

216
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:15,440
When I was younger, I used to dream that I got married to Mayor McCheese.
當我較年輕的時候 我曾經夢過跟麥當勞的卡通市長結婚

217
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:18,680
And on our wedding night, I ate his head.
然後在我們新婚之夜，我吃了他的頭

218
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,980
Okay.
好的

219
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:25,290
Well, this is like that..
這一點也…

220
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:27,360
in no way.
不像是那樣

221
00:14:27,530 --> 00:14:31,490
I had a dream last night that I wanted to kiss Joey.
我昨晚夢到我想要親喬伊

222
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:34,630
Wow! You mean like "kiss him" kiss him?
哇！你是說真的親吻他嗎？

223
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:38,140
Oh, yeah. I mean, it was pretty intense.
是啊，我是說那種很激情的

224
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:40,470
- What brought that on? - I don't know.
-為什麼會那樣呢？ -我不知道

225
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:43,670
Maybe it had to do with the fact I saw him do a love scene.
或許跟我看到他演出那場愛情戲有關

226
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:46,210
- A love scene? With who? - Olivia.
-愛情戲？跟誰呢？ -奧莉維亞

227
00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:49,680
Olivia?! I thought she was marrying Connor?!
奧莉維亞？我以為她要跟康納結婚了

228
00:14:49,850 --> 00:14:52,980
Oh, right. Real life more important.
對了，現實生活比較重要

229
00:14:53,190 --> 00:14:56,620
- You think my dream means anything? - I don't know.
-你認為我的夢代表什麼嗎？ -我不知道

230
00:14:56,790 --> 00:14:59,020
I mean, you saw him do a love scene.
你看到他演出愛情戲

231
00:14:59,190 --> 00:15:03,100
So maybe you don't have a thing for Joey. Maybe you have a thing for Drake.
或許對喬伊沒有感覺 或許你是對德克有感覺

232
00:15:06,830 --> 00:15:11,270
Well, it was Joey reading Drake's lines in the dream.
是啊，在夢裡是當喬伊 在念德克台詞的時候

233
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:15,200
Of course it was. Trust me, when it comes to psychology..
當然囉，相信我，只要是跟心理學有關

234
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:18,610
I know what I'm talking about.
我是很內行的

235
00:15:18,780 --> 00:15:20,970
I took two psych classes in college.
我在大學的時候修過兩堂心理學

236
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:22,980
You took the same class twice.
你一堂課重修兩次

237
00:15:23,150 --> 00:15:25,710
- It was hard! - I know.
-那很難耶！ -我知道

238
00:15:26,390 --> 00:15:28,720
- Hey. - Hi, Phoebe.
-嘿 -嗨，菲比

239
00:15:28,890 --> 00:15:33,350
Here, Monica, look what I got to wear when I play at your restaurant.
摩妮卡，瞧瞧我為了要到你餐廳演唱 買了什麼

240
00:15:38,170 --> 00:15:39,460
Wait.
等等

241
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:46,740
Right? I think this might even class up "The Ballad of the Uncircumcised Man."
我想這會提高 「沒有割包皮男人之民謠」的格調

242
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:51,200
Phoebe..
菲比…

243
00:15:51,380 --> 00:15:53,870
maybe I wasn't clear before.
或許我之前說的不夠清楚

244
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:57,970
I really love listening to your music here.
我真的很喜歡在這裡聽你的音樂

245
00:15:58,190 --> 00:16:01,050
But my restaurant, it's sort of an upscale place.
但是我的餐廳是比較高級的地方

246
00:16:01,260 --> 00:16:05,990
Right, yeah, okay. I'll ask the butler to fetch my diamonds out of the vault.
好的，好吧，我會要管家幫我把 我的鑽石從保險箱拿出來

247
00:16:06,190 --> 00:16:09,060
Phoebe, it's not what you wear.
菲比，不是你穿的衣服的關係

248
00:16:09,230 --> 00:16:11,890
It's sort of your songs.
是你的歌

249
00:16:12,570 --> 00:16:15,630
I just don't think you should play at the restaurant anymore.
我只是覺得你不應該再到餐廳演唱了

250
00:16:18,410 --> 00:16:21,310
Okay. Fine, I'll just..
好的，沒關係，我就…

251
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,500
I'll take the hat back.
我把帽子拿回去退

252
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:27,810
There.
好了

253
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:36,650
Hey, so, you guys, the funniest thing happened at work the..
嘿，我辦公室發生一件最好笑…

254
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:38,990
My songs aren't good enough for your restaurant?
我的歌不夠格登上你們餐廳的大堂嗎？

255
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:41,750
Okay, we're still on that.
好吧，我們還在談那個

256
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:45,450
- I didn't say they weren't good enough. - Then what's wrong with them?
-我沒有說它們不夠格 -那有什麼不對呢？

257
00:16:45,630 --> 00:16:48,760
What, they don't go with your tiny portions of pretentious food?
是怎樣？他們不夠格配你的 一丁點份的，自負的食物嗎？

258
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:52,270
- Tiny portions? - Yeah, well, "Excuse me.
-一丁點份？ -是啊不好意思…

259
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:57,640
I ordered the smoked salmon appetizer, but I can't see it. I can't see it."
我點了熏鮭魚 但是我看不到鮭魚，我看不到

260
00:16:59,780 --> 00:17:03,740
- Phoebe, it's not about quantity. - Well, it's not about quality.
-菲比，份量不是最重要的 -喔，品質也不是最重要的

261
00:17:04,650 --> 00:17:06,980
Oh, really? You wanna talk about quality?
真的嗎？你想要談品質嗎？

262
00:17:07,190 --> 00:17:11,520
Have you ever heard of a "key"? It's what some people sing in.
你有聽過什麼叫「調」嗎？ 那是大家唱歌要對的

263
00:17:11,690 --> 00:17:15,650
Well, at least all my songs don't taste like garlic.
至少我所有的歌都沒有蒜頭味

264
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:18,350
Yeah, there are other ingredients, Monica.
是的，摩妮卡 還有其它的東西可以拿來調味的

265
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,990
So that's what we're doing.
所以我們要這樣做囉

266
00:17:21,170 --> 00:17:24,160
When I'm in a coffeehouse bopping along to one of your songs..
當我在咖啡廳裡跟著你的歌打拍子時

267
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:25,740
I'm wearing earplugs.
我是有戴耳塞的

268
00:17:25,910 --> 00:17:28,070
Earplugs or cloves of garlic?
是耳塞還是蒜頭塞呢？

269
00:17:30,010 --> 00:17:32,210
You know what? I take back what I said before.
你知道嗎？我收回我所說的話

270
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:36,210
Keep playing at the restaurant, because with your music driving people inside..
繼續到餐廳演唱吧 因為你的音樂會把人逼進餐廳裡…

271
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:38,180
my bar sales have gone up like crazy.
我們吧檯的營業量會瘋狂激長的

272
00:17:38,350 --> 00:17:41,320
What are people having, the garlic martini?
他們都點什麼呢？蒜頭馬丁尼嗎？

273
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:51,330
So you wanna hear my work story?
那你想要聽聽我今天工作的事嗎？

274
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:52,890
I'll save it.
我省省好了

275
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:57,930
Here's your bill. We hope you enjoyed your stay.
這是您的帳單，希望您還住的愉快

276
00:17:58,110 --> 00:18:00,770
Oh, we did. And you still have all your lamps.
喔，我們很愉快 而且你們的檯燈都還在

277
00:18:03,910 --> 00:18:07,680
- I didn't factor in the room tax. - Dude, don't worry about it.
-我沒有算進稅金 -兄弟，不用擔心

278
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:11,250
I found an unattended maid's cart. We're way ahead of the game.
我找到了一台沒人看管的女傭拖車 我們是居領先地位的

279
00:18:13,090 --> 00:18:15,390
- Oh, my God. - What?
-喔，我的天 -怎樣？

280
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:18,180
There's something new in the bowl.
那盆子裡有新的東西

281
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:23,160
- Look, we have enough. Just walk away. - No, but I want the pine cones.
-聽著，我們拿夠了，走吧 -不，但是我想要松果

282
00:18:24,030 --> 00:18:27,760
- There's a forest right outside. - It's not the same.
-外面就有一片森林 -那不一樣

283
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:31,330
- No, look. She's gonna see us. - No, she won't. I'm sly.
-不，她會看到的 -不，她不會，我會動作很快的

284
00:18:31,810 --> 00:18:33,800
Okay, go quick.
好吧，快點

285
00:18:41,280 --> 00:18:44,110
Thank you for a delightful stay.
謝謝你們令人愉快的服務

286
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:53,860
My maple candy!
我的楓糖糖果！

287
00:19:06,310 --> 00:19:11,110
It's just you. I thought someone was swinging a bag of cats against the wall.
原來是你，我還以為有人 拿了一袋子的貓往牆上揮

288
00:19:11,410 --> 00:19:15,070
You'd better get back in that kitchen. The garlic's not gonna overuse itself.
你最好回去廚房 蒜頭是不會自己多用自己的

289
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:18,640
- Okay, you have to stop playing now. - Why?
-好了，你現在必須要停唱了 -為什麼？

290
00:19:18,820 --> 00:19:21,120
The only person my playing is bothering is you.
我的歌干擾到的人只有你

291
00:19:21,290 --> 00:19:26,490
- Oh, yeah? Let's settle this. Come on. - Get your garlic peelers off me.
-是嗎？我們來解決這件事，來吧 -把你的蒜頭手拿開

292
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:29,100
Excuse me? Excuse me?
不好意思，不好意思

293
00:19:29,260 --> 00:19:32,790
Hi, I'm Monica Geller. I'm the head chef here.
我是摩妮卡蓋勒，這裡的主廚

294
00:19:33,430 --> 00:19:36,960
Okay, I was actually expecting a little applause there, but whatever.
好的，我本來真的希望有人鼓掌的 但是沒關係

295
00:19:37,140 --> 00:19:39,940
Quick question. By a show of hands..
一個問題，請大家舉手回答

296
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:43,700
how many of you were bothered by this woman's singing outside?
你們有誰被這女人 在外面唱歌干擾到呢？

297
00:19:45,150 --> 00:19:48,310
Okay, okay. Well, I have a question.
好的，好的，我有個問題

298
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:49,880
You can put your hand down.
你們現在可以把手放下了

299
00:19:50,050 --> 00:19:54,080
You made your point earlier when you spit in my guitar case.
你剛剛吐口水到我的吉他箱上 就已經表達的很清楚了

300
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:59,160
Okay, okay. How many of you enjoyed the music outside?
好的，你們有誰喜歡外面的音樂呢？

301
00:20:00,530 --> 00:20:03,890
Let me ask you this question. How many thought the music was fine..
讓我問你們這個問題 有誰認為音樂還好…

302
00:20:04,060 --> 00:20:06,530
but not in keeping with the tone of the restaurant?
但是跟本餐廳的格調不符呢？

303
00:20:07,370 --> 00:20:13,500
Okay, well, who identified this restaurant's tone as "pretentious-comma-garlicky"?
好的，誰認為這個餐廳的格調是 「自以為是又充滿蒜頭味」呢？

304
00:20:13,670 --> 00:20:19,810
Okay, who thinks the food is delicious and a little pretension never hurt anyone?
好的，有誰覺得食物是很美味的 而一點點做作是沒關係的？

305
00:20:20,550 --> 00:20:24,040
Okay, well, all right, who thinks the food is fine, the music was fine..
好了，沒關係，有誰覺得食物很好 音樂也很棒

306
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:27,750
but your evening was ruined by this incessant poll-taking?
但是你的晚餐已經被這個持續不斷 的民意調查給毀了？

307
00:20:31,390 --> 00:20:32,690
Excuse us.
不好意思

308
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:38,560
All right, here's a question.
好了，我問你

309
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:42,770
Who was so worried about her restaurant being fancy..
有誰認為她的餐廳是那麼的高級…

310
00:20:42,940 --> 00:20:46,130
that she made a big deal about her friend playing her music..
讓她過分的擔心 她的朋友會演唱不適當的音樂…

311
00:20:46,340 --> 00:20:49,610
and feels really bad about it now?
而現在真的覺得很難過呢？

312
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:53,240
Well, who was so stupid and stubborn..
有誰很愚蠢又很頑固…

313
00:20:53,410 --> 00:20:55,880
that she lashed out against her friend's cooking..
批評了她朋友的烹飪技術…

314
00:20:56,050 --> 00:20:58,710
which she actually thinks is pretty great?
而其實她是覺得她的烹飪很好呢？

315
00:20:59,550 --> 00:21:02,490
- I'm sorry. - I'm sorry too.
-我很抱歉 -我也很抱歉

316
00:21:02,790 --> 00:21:05,760
Hey, you wanna stick around and I'll whip you up some dinner?
嘿，你要不要留下來 然後我幫你準備晚餐呢？

317
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:07,790
Yeah, as long as it's free.
好啊，只要是免費的

318
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:10,560
The food here is ridiculously overpr..
這裡的食物真的是超貴…

319
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:17,030
Who hopes the hand-raising thing is still cute enough that you won't hate me?
誰希望舉手這件事 還可愛到使你不要恨我呢？

320
00:21:20,810 --> 00:21:22,540
- Hey. - Hey.
-嘿 -嘿

321
00:21:23,840 --> 00:21:27,910
Joey, do you have peanut butter on the back of your head?
喬伊，你的頭後面有花生醬嗎？

322
00:21:30,950 --> 00:21:34,180
Oh, man. I thought I got it all.
喔，天啊，我以為我都擦掉了

323
00:21:35,620 --> 00:21:37,110
How..?
怎麼會…

324
00:21:37,290 --> 00:21:39,090
How?
怎麼弄到的呢？

325
00:21:39,330 --> 00:21:41,790
I was making a peanut butter smoothie, right?
我正在做花生醬冰沙

326
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:46,130
I couldn't find this little plastic thingy that goes in the top of the blender.
我找不到果汁機上面那個小塑膠蓋

327
00:21:46,300 --> 00:21:50,460
And I thought, "Well, you know, how important can that be?" Right?
然後我想 「那個小東西有什麼重要的呢？」

328
00:21:51,040 --> 00:21:52,800
Turns out, very.
結果是非常重要

329
00:21:54,570 --> 00:21:56,540
Wow, definitely just Drake.
哇，一定只是因為德克

330
00:21:57,140 --> 00:21:59,370
- What? - How's it going with Drake?
-什麼？ -德克演的如何呢？

331
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:02,850
- I don't think it's going very well. - What?
-我想可能演的不是很好 -什麼？

332
00:22:03,050 --> 00:22:04,880
That scene I saw was so good.
我看的那一場戲很好啊

333
00:22:05,090 --> 00:22:09,720
Well, I'm feeling really insecure about the one we're shooting tomorrow.
我對明天要拍的那場戲 覺得很沒安全感

334
00:22:10,020 --> 00:22:14,150
Is this that thing you do when you say you're bad so I'll give you a compliment?
你是不是又故意說自己很糟 然後讓我來讚美你呢？

335
00:22:14,490 --> 00:22:16,260
A little.
有點

336
00:22:16,660 --> 00:22:23,030
No, I really am worried. I have to make it convincing that I'm in love with Olivia.
不，我是真的很擔心 我必須要演得像是我真的愛上奧莉維亞

337
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:26,200
- So? - So I've never played that.
-所以呢？ -所以…我從來沒有演過那種戲

338
00:22:26,370 --> 00:22:30,210
Oh, honey, it can't be that hard. I mean, you've been in love before.
喔，親愛的，那不會很難的 你也有談過戀愛啊

339
00:22:30,910 --> 00:22:34,240
Well, just once..
嗯，只有一次…

340
00:22:34,410 --> 00:22:36,180
with you.
就是跟你

341
00:22:38,220 --> 00:22:40,550
Okay. Well, this could be a little awkward.
好了，這實在是有點尷尬

342
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:43,050
I'm just gonna blow past it.
我們跳過好了

343
00:22:43,220 --> 00:22:46,250
Well, look, can't you just use that method-actor thing..
聽著，你何不運用你那個特殊方法

344
00:22:46,490 --> 00:22:50,050
where you use your real-life memories to help you in your performance?
就是利用你的真實生活回憶 來幫助演出呢？

345
00:22:51,530 --> 00:22:53,930
What the hell are you talking about?
你在說什麼？

346
00:22:57,240 --> 00:23:02,230
All right, look, just try to remember how you felt when you were in love..
好的，只要試著回憶起 你在談戀愛時候的感覺

347
00:23:02,410 --> 00:23:05,900
and think about that when you're playing the scene.
然後在演出的時候回想起那些感覺

348
00:23:08,150 --> 00:23:11,450
Okay. Yeah, I think I can do that.
好的，是啊，我想我做的到

349
00:23:11,620 --> 00:23:14,710
Yeah. Okay, there's this party scene coming up.
好的，有個晚會的劇情

350
00:23:14,890 --> 00:23:17,150
And Olivia and her husband are there..
奧莉維亞跟她老公就在那裡

351
00:23:17,320 --> 00:23:21,660
and all Drake wants to do is grab her and kiss her, but he can't.
而德克想要做的只有抓住她 然後親吻她，但是他不能

352
00:23:22,660 --> 00:23:27,220
That makes me think about those times I wanted to grab you and kiss you..
那讓我想起許多時候我好想抓住你 然後親吻你

353
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:30,670
but you didn't know, so I would just pretend everything was cool..
但是你並不知道 所以我只能假裝沒事

354
00:23:30,840 --> 00:23:32,900
but really it was killing me.
但這真的讓我很受折磨

355
00:23:34,910 --> 00:23:38,940
Joey, you never talked about that before.
喬伊，你從來沒有說過這些

356
00:23:41,050 --> 00:23:43,570
Hey, you know what else I could use?
嘿，你知道我還可以用什麼嗎？

357
00:23:44,180 --> 00:23:47,520
There's this scene where Drake sneaks into Olivia's bedroom..
有一場戲是德克偷偷溜進 奧莉維亞的房間

358
00:23:47,690 --> 00:23:50,880
and she doesn't know he's there, which never happened with us.
她不知道他就在那裡 當然，我們之間沒有發生過這樣的事

359
00:23:53,460 --> 00:23:58,450
I mean, he knows he shouldn't be there, but he just wants to look at her.
他知道他不應該去那裡 但是他只想看看她

360
00:23:59,830 --> 00:24:01,300
You know?
你知道嗎？

361
00:24:01,470 --> 00:24:06,460
And I remember all those mornings before you even put on your makeup..
而且我記得有好幾個早上 就在你開始要化妝之前

362
00:24:06,640 --> 00:24:12,010
when I would think to myself, "My God, she is beautiful."
我會想「天啊，她真是美麗」

363
00:24:13,710 --> 00:24:18,150
And it hurt so much because I knew I could never tell you.
而且讓我好心痛 因為我知道我永遠不能告訴你

364
00:24:21,490 --> 00:24:25,750
But it was worth it just to be there looking at you.
但是光是看著你 我就覺得心滿意足了

365
00:24:32,130 --> 00:24:34,030
Thanks, dude. This is great!
謝了，真是太棒了！

366
00:24:44,410 --> 00:24:46,740
I got you something from Vermont.
我從佛蒙特州幫你帶了些東西

367
00:24:46,910 --> 00:24:49,110
Besides tampons and salt?
衛生麵條跟鹽巴以外的東西嗎？

368
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:52,410
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天

369
00:24:52,590 --> 00:24:56,180
Maple candy. That's so sweet of you.
楓糖糖果，你真是貼心

370
00:24:57,220 --> 00:24:59,220
That's weird, it's empty.
真是奇怪，裡面是空的

371
00:24:59,560 --> 00:25:04,020
Hi, you guys. What's going on? You guys wanna hang out or..?
嘿，你們好，怎麼了呢？ 你們要一起怎樣嗎？

372
00:25:11,140 --> 00:25:13,040
Do you guys hear a buzzing?
你們有聽到嗡嗡聲嗎？

373
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


374
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
